<h2 style="color: #333333;">Hello {{firstName}},</h2>
<p style="color: #555555; font-size: 16px;">
  You requested a password reset. Use the following OTP to reset your password:
</p>
<div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; text-align: center; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <span style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 5px; color: #333333;">{{otp}}</span>
</div>
<p style="color: #777777; font-size: 14px;">
  This OTP is valid for <strong>15 minutes</strong>. If you did not request this, please ignore this email.
</p>
